__pycache__/
node_modules/

# Follow-up work (v1.2.0). Not part of the package:
# - harness/: local clones of this repository at 9c9eee2 used to run streams B and E-pay, with their own .git,
#   node_modules and the upstream payment app (about 1.3 GB each). The harness is this repository at tag v1.1.4.
followups-2026-11/*/harness/
followups-2026-11/*/*/harness/
# - empty per-trial lock files that the ledger leaves next to each trial blob (as in moodle-ledger/, none shipped).
#   The ledgers' top-level trials.lock files are kept because d-moodle-replay/SHA256SUMS lists them.
followups-2026-11/**/blobs/trials/*.lock
# No file in the package exceeds GitHub's limits (largest: followups-2026-11/e-single-set/pay/logs/app.log, 6.6 MB).
